---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Juan Ramirez | Engineer, Writer, and Adaptive Runner"
  description="Personal website of Juan Ramirez: thoughts on acquired brain injury, technology, and the projects that shape a life in motion."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl space-y-7">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted">Personal introduction</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">
      I am Juan Ramirez: software engineer, writer, and adaptive runner.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">
      In 2020, a neurosurgery changed the trajectory of my life. Since then, I have been writing about
      acquired brain injury, technology, and whatever else feels true and worth sharing.
    </p>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">
      This site is not about reducing identity to a single label. It is where my technical work, personal
      writing, and ongoing process coexist.
    </p>
    <div class="pt-3 text-base">
      <a href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
      <span class="mx-3 text-muted">·</span>
      <a href="/portfolio">Browse portfolio</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
